# The built copy. It is generated by `node build.js` and, in the two-repository
# arrangement described in BUILD.md, it is published to the *public* site repo
# rather than committed here. If you decide instead to keep one public repo and
# serve the built files from it, delete this line and commit dist/.
dist/

# Only ever created by `npx` pulling terser down for a build.
node_modules/
